WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.950
It's midsummer in London.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.830
Before 3 in the morning, a
family eats a quiet meal.

3
00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:11.920
Then nothing: no food, not even
water, until after 9 at night.

4
00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:16.100
This is Ramadan, the ninth
month of the Islamic calendar.

5
00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:20.610
Because the calendar follows the moon,
Ramadan moves through the seasons.

6
00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:24.100
So why would millions of people
choose to go without water,

7
00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:26.320
all day, for a month?

8
00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:29.280
In this mission, you'll
follow one day of fasting,

9
00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:32.490
from the meal before dawn
to the meal at sunset.

10
00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:37.240
Then you'll discover a single night that
the Qur'an calls better than a thousand

11
00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:38.330
months.

12
00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:42.190
Your mission: find out why
Muslims fast through Ramadan.
